        <!-- ============================ middle slot ============================
             The slot holds exactly one occupant, so the machine is a star rather than a mesh: every
             morph starts from the Wi-Fi pose and returns to it, which is also why the arcs always
             retract the same way before anything new arrives. One number (`middleMode`) picks the
             occupant, because a transition can compare a number and the slot can only hold one thing.

             The 1-frame `loop` poses are load-bearing, not decoration: a machine only advances while a
             playing animation exists, and it only draws while it advances. -->

