        <!-- Wi-Fi -> airplane. The arcs retract and slide to fraction 0.5 (the bottom of each ellipse -
             as close to the glyph's centre as a trim window can reach) over 7 frames, and the plane
             grows out of that region over the next 4, so there is no dead frame. The plane seats with a
             small back-out: that is what makes it read as "placed" rather than "switched on". -->
